# Run verification checks against runtime configuration arrays
state = load_json("/mobile-infographic-engine/configs/system_state.json")
forbidden_list = state["dynamic_restrictions"]["forbidden_tokens"]

[ASSERT_1]: FOR EACH token IN forbidden_list:
              IF token exists in layout output text -> FAIL & RE-RENDER.
              
[ASSERT_2]: IF any single point or metric from the raw prompt content is omitted -> FAIL & RE-RENDER.
[ASSERT_3]: IF font scale falls below system_state.json -> typography.base_font_size -> FAIL.
[ASSERT_4]: Verify padding constraints match state.ui_elements.padding specifications.

# [ASSERT_5]: Verify that image fallback routing correctly pulled assets from either the virtual directories OR the <prompt> filename context.

